-- תקנון שירות עובדי הוראה, פרק 1א', §1.18 תוספת למורים למחוננים
-- A teacher of classes of gifted children is paid as if the hours taught in
-- those classes were 20% more than the hours actually taught there.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `1.18 תוספת למורים למחוננים`

@desc A teacher's week of teaching, as far as section 1.18 asks about it.
DECLARE `teaching week` HAS
    `hours actually taught`                 IS A NUMBER  @desc all the weekly hours the teacher actually teaches
    `hours actually taught in gifted classes` IS A NUMBER @desc of those, the weekly hours actually taught in classes populated by gifted children
    `date of the salary month`              IS A NUMBER  @desc the salary month as a number YYYYMMDD (e.g. 19830901)

-- 1 September 1983, written YYYYMMDD.
`the start of the gifted-class arrangement` MEANS 19830901

§§ `1.18 ¶1–¶2 The 20% credit`

-- ¶1: from 1.9.83 salary is computed as if the teacher taught 20% more hours;
-- ¶2 settles the base of that 20%: the hours actually taught in gifted
-- classes, not all the teacher's hours.
@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_18__ssec_1_18/p1
GIVEN w IS A `teaching week`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the gifted-class credit applies` w IF
        w's `date of the salary month` AT LEAST `the start of the gifted-class arrangement`
    AND w's `hours actually taught in gifted classes` GREATER THAN 0

@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_18__ssec_1_18/p2
GIVEN w IS A `teaching week`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the gifted-class credit in hours` w IS
    IF `the gifted-class credit applies` w
    THEN w's `hours actually taught in gifted classes` TIMES 20%
    ELSE 0

@export default The weekly hours a teacher's salary is computed on under section 1.18 of the takanon, adding 20% of the hours actually taught in classes of gifted children
GIVEN w IS A `teaching week` @desc the teacher's week of teaching
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `hours the salary is computed on` w IS
    w's `hours actually taught` PLUS `the gifted-class credit in hours` w

DECLARE `gifted-class action` IS ONE OF
    `pay salary for hours` HAS `hours paid for` IS A NUMBER

-- The duty the credit puts on the employer, in salary months: the month's
-- salary is paid on the credited hours.
GIVEN w IS A `teaching week`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `gifted-class action`
DECIDE `pay on the credited hours` w IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay salary for hours` h
          PROVIDED h AT LEAST `hours the salary is computed on` w
    WITHIN 1
    LEST  BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "section 1.18: salary is computed as if 20% more hours were taught in gifted classes"

§§ `1.18 ¶3`

-- ¶3: this arrangement cancels every earlier one on the matter, so from its
-- start no earlier arrangement governs. What the earlier arrangements were
-- the takanon does not say; it only names them so as to cancel them.
@ref akn:chp_1א___sec_1_18__ssec_1_18/p3
DECLARE `gifted-class arrangement` IS ONE OF
    `the arrangement of section 1.18`
    `an earlier arrangement`

GIVEN `salary month` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `gifted-class arrangement`
DECIDE `the arrangement that governs` `salary month` IS
    IF `salary month` AT LEAST `the start of the gifted-class arrangement`
    THEN `the arrangement of section 1.18`
    ELSE `an earlier arrangement`

-- Worked examples. The hours are placeholders, not from any payslip.
`a teacher with 10 of 24 hours in gifted classes` MEANS
    `teaching week` WITH
        `hours actually taught`                   IS 24
        `hours actually taught in gifted classes` IS 10
        `date of the salary month`                IS 19840101

-- The 20% is of the 10 gifted-class hours only (¶2), not of all 24.
#ASSERT `hours the salary is computed on` `a teacher with 10 of 24 hours in gifted classes` EQUALS 26
#ASSERT NOT `hours the salary is computed on` `a teacher with 10 of 24 hours in gifted classes` EQUALS 24 TIMES 1.2

`the same week before 1.9.83` MEANS
    `teaching week` WITH
        `hours actually taught`                   IS 24
        `hours actually taught in gifted classes` IS 10
        `date of the salary month`                IS 19830801

#ASSERT `hours the salary is computed on` `the same week before 1.9.83` EQUALS 24
#ASSERT `the arrangement that governs` 19830801 EQUALS `an earlier arrangement`
#EVAL   `the arrangement that governs` 19840101

#TRACE `pay on the credited hours` `a teacher with 10 of 24 hours in gifted classes` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay salary for hours` 26 AT 1
#TRACE `pay on the credited hours` `a teacher with 10 of 24 hours in gifted classes` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay salary for hours` 24 AT 1

-- akn:chp_1א___sec_1_18__ssec_1_18/p4 The heading of the section's source list (אסמכתא).
-- akn:chp_1א___sec_1_18__ssec_1_18/p5 The source itself: a Director-General's circular.
